{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2020-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1606780800, "end_date": 1607385599, "month_true_total": 87, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:52:15 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "81798706", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065506048", "personaname": "Lamron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198065506048/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 12857, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6474, "last_played": 1610455437, "avatar": "c77d8b2f4dc94dbee60f29582a125c5b2bb82b7c"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the finest games I've ever played, of one of the greatest franchises ever played. The game and the franchise have their flaws, and over all the story may have inconsistencies, but in the moment when you're playing the games themselves, nothing feels better really.", "timestamp_created": 1607369635, "timestamp_updated": 1607369635, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81742173", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091691296", "personaname": "Colto", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091691296/", "num_games_owned": 393, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2493, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2488, "last_played": 1607281931, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very fun wrap up to the mass effect trilogy, enjoyable gameplay, good story and great feeling of progression in powers, weapon customisation on collecting.", "timestamp_created": 1607281567, "timestamp_updated": 1607281567, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81734812", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148324839", "personaname": "Sonyachna", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zombiemarimo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2399, "last_played": 1607272508, "avatar": "94910f47fc0fa83fc70e018595d922d74866a576"}, "language": "english", "review": "After 39h of playing the game it just stopped loading. EA support is useless, i can't get a refund as well. Feels lile a scam.", "timestamp_created": 1607272634, "timestamp_updated": 1607272634, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.485859185457229614", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81712050", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091034602", "personaname": "Unknown User", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091034602/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2636, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1161, "last_played": 1607564975, "avatar": "c4d7ac178d8324a46a5315ac7310e3d67a9b83ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1607244642, "timestamp_updated": 1607244642, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495984554290771484", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81684213", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030550043", "personaname": "Mewgles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mewgles/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 1673, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1673, "last_played": 1607190852, "avatar": "3f57cab8c857e2998b77da874b1046c2f7fc80f2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Had a few minor crashes during my playthrough, but the checkpoints and autosaves were good enough to prevent me from having more than a few minutes of lost progress because of them.\n\nOverall the story was pretty good and the occasional small plotholes or weird dialogue choices didn't really hurt it. I'll blame it on translation issues since I played the game in german. Not gonna get into any further detail about it since any comment would be a spoiler. \n\nOne thing that did bother me was the clunky cover mechanics and the overall choice to make spacebar do pretty much everything. From getting into cover, to jumping over it to interacting with objects. I ended up dead a few times because of that and also getting cover behind objects that I wanted to interact with instead which looked quite silly. But that was really the only Issue I had with the game besides the mentioned crashes.\n\nSo if you don't mind the small risk of maybe one or two game crashes and the slightly clunky mechanics (which might not be clunky at all in your eyes, who knows), then you should give it a go. Especially if you played the previous games.", "timestamp_created": 1607203179, "timestamp_updated": 1607203179, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81666175", "author": {"steamid": "76561198176664793", "personaname": "Sid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198176664793/", "num_games_owned": 136, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 94153, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 240, "playtime_at_review": 3132, "last_played": 1791383909, "avatar": "430a2387fe57f36a41967ba58f9d0f8f43c7404b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Had to turn origin in-game off twice in origin app and game app separately for it to play smoothly.Other than that good Single-Player Campaign and Mutiplayer Characters.Although it would be better if leviathan and citadel DLC came already bunched with this deluxe edition.Also if it gave 21 point or more for sp character from start it would make mars mission fairer on insanity.", "timestamp_created": 1607183023, "timestamp_updated": 1607183023, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81642095", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082610824", "personaname": "Ocelot", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082610824/", "num_games_owned": 1177, "num_reviews": 632, "playtime_forever": 138, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 48, "last_played": 1607157885, "avatar": "87110f1b1778e027714ddb44261d7affc77b78d5"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm trying to play through some of this in preparation for the Mass Effect Trilogy remastered but I just can't get into it, so many technical issues. Maybe play it on console? or just wait and pray that the Mass Effect trilogy remaster is top notch and launches on steam. I hope it truly lives up.", "timestamp_created": 1607154136, "timestamp_updated": 1607154136, 